		{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":465,"y":280,"width":330,"height":190,"text":"**1.** kéo 1 thẻ vật liệu\n`OnDragDetected`\n↗ [[WBP_MaterialCard#OnDragDetected — MỚI (S7.G5.1, 11/09/2026, as-built)|WBP_MaterialCard › OnDragDetected]]\n<small>← User · thao tác người dùng</small>"},
		{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":905,"y":510,"width":330,"height":256,"text":"**2.** phủ lớp kéo-thả, chỉ có ảnh nhỏ, không có bóng 3D\n`Create WBP_DragOverlay + BP_DragDropOperation_Material(MaterialRowName)`\n↗ [[WBP_MaterialCard#BP_DragDropOperation_Material — class mới (parent `DragDropOperation`)|WBP_MaterialCard › BP_DragDropOperation_Material]]\n<small>← WBP_MaterialCard · theo doc</small>"},
		{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":905,"y":806,"width":330,"height":212,"text":"**3.** thả lên 1 món\n`On Drop (nhánh Material)`\n↗ [[WBP_DragOverlay_FurnitureCard#On Drop — v1.10 S7.G5.3+G5.4 (material branch + dọn scaffolding, 11/09/2026)|WBP_DragOverlay_FurnitureCard › On Drop]]\n<small>← User · thao tác người dùng</small>"},
		{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":1345,"y":1058,"width":330,"height":256,"text":"**4.** bắn tia tại điểm thả → món + slot dưới chuột\n`TraceSlotUnderCursor(PC, DropScreenPos, 5000)`\n↗ [[MaterialSlotService_Reference#TraceSlotUnderCursor(PC, TraceDistance, OutActor, OutSlotIndex, OutSlotName) → bool|MaterialSlotService_Reference › TraceSlotUnderCursor]]\n<small>← WBP_DragOverlay · ✓K2</small>"},
		{"id":"s5","type":"text","x":2225,"y":1354,"width":330,"height":256,"text":"▸ nếu trúng đồ nội thất\n**5.** giao việc cho chính món đó\n`ApplyMaterialByRowName(SlotName, SlotIndex, RowName)`\n↗ [[BP_FurnitureActor#ApplyMaterialByRowName(SlotName String, SlotIndex Integer, RowName Name) — Custom Event MỚI (S7.G5.2, 11/09/2026)|BP_FurnitureActor › ApplyMaterialByRowName]]\n<small>← WBP_DragOverlay · ✓K2</small>"},
		{"id":"s6","type":"text","x":1785,"y":1650,"width":330,"height":146,"text":"▸ ngược lại: trúng tường / kiến trúc\n**6.** báo lỗi nhẹ\n`ToastRef.ShowToast(\"Chỉ áp vật liệu lên đồ nội thất\")`\n<small>← WBP_DragOverlay · ✓K2</small>","color":"3"},
		{"id":"s7","type":"text","x":905,"y":1836,"width":330,"height":102,"text":"**7.** gỡ lớp phủ (mọi nhánh)\n`Remove From Parent → Return true`\n<small>nội bộ · ✓K2</small>"},
		{"id":"s8","type":"text","x":2225,"y":1978,"width":330,"height":168,"text":"**8.** nhớ slot + RowName qua khe async rồi tải vật liệu\n`SET Apply_PendingSlotName, Apply_PendingSlotIndex, Apply_PendingRowName → Async Load Asset`\n<small>nội bộ · theo doc</small>"},
		{"id":"s9","type":"text","x":1345,"y":2186,"width":330,"height":234,"text":"**9.** gắn vật liệu vào slot\n`ApplyLoadedMaterialToSlot()`\n↗ [[MaterialSlotService_Reference#ApplyLoadedMaterialToSlot(Mesh, Records&, SlotName, HintIndex, LoadedMI, RowName, PathFallback) → bool|MaterialSlotService_Reference › ApplyLoadedMaterialToSlot]]\n<small>← BP_FurnitureActor · theo doc</small>"},
		{"id":"s10","type":"text","x":2665,"y":2460,"width":330,"height":190,"text":"**10.** ghi sổ\n`CaptureSnapshot(\"ApplyMaterial\")`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#CaptureSnapshot(ActionName) — v1.20 VIẾT LẠI còn 2 node (U2.3)|BP_UndoManager › CaptureSnapshot]]\n<small>← BP_FurnitureActor · theo doc</small>"},
		{"id":"s11","type":"text","x":3105,"y":2690,"width":330,"height":146,"text":"**11.** thêm vào Gần đây\n`AddRecentMaterial(Apply_PendingRowName)`\n<small>← BP_FurnitureActor · theo doc</small>"},
		{"id":"s12","type":"text","x":3545,"y":2876,"width":330,"height":300,"text":"**12.** nếu món này đang mở panel → chọn đúng slot, tô sáng, làm mới panel\n`SET SelectedSlotIndex → RefreshSlotSwatches() → HighlightSwatchByIndex() → RefreshParamPanel()`\n↗ [[WBP_FurnitureInventory#RefreshSlotSwatches — v1.2 — SỬA 18/09/2026 (đóng `Bug-MaterialEdit-EnableState`, phần 1/2)|WBP_FurnitureInventory › RefreshSlotSwatches]]\n<small>← BP_FurnitureActor · theo doc</small>"}
